{
  "_comment": [
    "Everything tools/build_kit.py downloads to assemble a kit. Nothing here is committed to git.",
    "tier: small | medium | large (a tier includes all lower tiers). optional: only with --with-<id>.",
    "sha256/size: pinned content. null = not pinned yet; run `python3 tools/build_kit.py --lock` on a",
    "  trusted, networked machine, review the diff and commit it. --frozen (used by CI) refuses unpinned items.",
    "kind: file | tar | zip (download) | zim-extract (an entry from a pinned ZIM item, needs libzim) |",
    "  git (a pinned commit; git verifies content) | pmtiles (map extract, data only, unpinnable; falls back to the newest Protomaps build).",
    "replaces: ids of lower-tier items this one supersedes (e.g. WikiMed maxi replaces WikiMed mini).",
    "redistributable: false = may be built for personal use but must never be published (publish_gcs.py refuses)."
  ],
  "tools": {
    "go-pmtiles": {
      "module": "github.com/protomaps/go-pmtiles",
      "version": "v1.31.2",
      "go": "1.25.0",
      "_note": "Built with `go install module@version`; the Go checksum database (sum.golang.org) verifies the source. go: the module's minimum Go (the `go` line of its go.mod); the golang image in cloudbuild.yaml and GOTOOLCHAIN in publish.yml must meet it (tests/test_build_kit.py checks)."
    }
  },
